WEBVTT

00:03:00.468 --> 00:03:01.636
Hello.

00:03:01.636 --> 00:03:02.678
(Echoes)

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.056
And at the bottom of that cave

00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:06.974
is an X marks the spot.

00:03:07.016 --> 00:03:09.393
And of course, he's the best
pirate on the seas,

00:03:09.435 --> 00:03:11.812
so he's going to dig for buried treasure.

00:03:12.146 --> 00:03:13.314
(Panting)

00:03:13.356 --> 00:03:15.983
It's a lot of work digging for treasure.

00:03:15.983 --> 00:03:17.235
(Metallic sound)

00:03:17.276 --> 00:03:18.986
And that's when he discovered ...

00:03:21.113 --> 00:03:23.199
That he -- (Screams)

00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:24.408
Whoa.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:27.495
That he was not the first pirate
to look for this treasure.

00:03:27.787 --> 00:03:31.249
But that boy had many adventures
with this box over the years.